<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>DC Mini</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor, Heriot</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Sundiver</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">46111wvhzGDGWKLtwBr9d4</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.090" end="00:18.570">It resets and starts again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.570" end="00:26.570">The purge of every old weekend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.070" end="00:31.140">Clean the gutters</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.140" end="00:34.770">Bleach the sea</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.770" end="00:37.470">Raise the shutters</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.470" end="00:38.970">leave me be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.880" end="00:43.470">Oooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.470" end="00:44.970">This is how it is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.950" end="00:45.450">Oooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.980" end="00:51.980">Take it or leave it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.050" end="00:53.550">Oooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.080" end="01:00.080">Cause I don’t know the first thing about about how to live</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.150" end="01:11.150">It resets and starts again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.870" end="01:23.870">A graveyard of old phone boxes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.430" end="01:43.430">What are you eating, what are you watching?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.970" end="01:55.470">A flood as far as the eye can see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.570" end="01:56.070">At least It made people like you angry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.350" end="01:56.850">Oooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.380" end="01:56.880">This is how it is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.710" end="01:57.210">Oooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.740" end="02:03.740">Take it or leave it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.570" end="02:32.070">Oooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.600" end="02:38.600">Cause I don’t know the first thing about about how to live</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.810" end="03:01.810">It resets and starts again</p></div></body></tt>